  ('sf-7-talon-stealth-vtol-jet-fighter', 'Large Wings (2)', 200, 'Each. Losing one (and a VTOL engine with it) spins the jet into the ground: no VTOL, and all aboard die unless ejected. The crash does 2D4x100 M.D. to a 300 foot (91 m) radius; nothing is salvageable.', 6),
