  ('afc-111-scout-rocket-cycle', 1, 'C-RF4 Rapid-Fire Pulse Lasers (4)', '2D6 per single blast, 4D6 per double, 6D6 per triple and 8D6 per full blast (no unit printed); simultaneous blasts are one melee attack', 1, '1800 feet (548.6 m)', 'Equal to the pilot''s hand to hand attacks', 'Effectively unlimited', NULL, 'Anti-aircraft and anti-armor, secondary strafing/anti-personnel. Four short-barreled lasers in the nose, each pivoting 30 degrees in all directions.'),
