  ('afc-115-warbird-rocket-cycle', 2, 'Forward Lasers (2)', '2D6 per single blast or 4D6 per double blast (no unit printed); a simultaneous dual blast is one melee attack', 1, '2000 feet (610 m)', 'Equal to the pilot''s hand to hand attacks', 'Effectively unlimited', NULL, 'Strafing/anti-personnel, secondary defense. In the nose, each pivoting 45 degrees in all directions.'),
