  ('afc-115-warbird-rocket-cycle', 4, 'Concealed Mini-Missile Launchers (2)', 'Varies with missile; standard issue fragmentation (5D6 M.D.) and plasma (1D6x10 M.D.)', 1, 'About one mile', 'One at a time or in volleys of two, three, four or five', 'Twenty; 10 in each launcher', NULL, 'Anti-aircraft/armor, secondary anti-personnel. In the forward sections of the two main jet housings.'),
