  ('afc-033-wind-jammer-sky-cycle', 1, 'CR-33 Mini-Missile Launcher (1)', 'Varies with missile; standard issue fragmentation (5D6 M.D.) and plasma (1D6x10 M.D.)', 1, 'About one mile', 'One at a time or in volleys of two, three or four', '24 total', NULL, 'Anti-personnel, secondary anti-armor (tanks, robots, dragons). Concealed in the weapon appendage; fires only when the appendage is open.'),
