  ('ch-10-black-lightning-combat-helicopter', 2, 'Nose Rail Gun (1)', '6D6 M.D. per 40 round burst', 1, '4000 feet (1220 m)', 'Equal to the pilot''s combined hand to hand attacks (usually 4-6)', '4000 round drum, 100 bursts', NULL, 'Anti-aircraft, secondary anti-personnel and defense. Worked by the pilot or the co-pilot/gunner.'),
  ('ch-10-black-lightning-combat-helicopter', 3, 'C-33 Weapon Appendage Rail Guns (2 sets)', '1D6x10 M.D. per 40 round burst from one gun, 2D6x10 M.D. from two; simultaneous bursts on one target are one melee attack', 1, '4000 feet (1220 m)', 'Equal to the gunner''s combined hand to hand attacks (usually 4-6)', '2000 round drum, 50 bursts per rail gun; 8000 rounds (200 bursts) total. Reloading a drum takes about 20 minutes untrained, five with engineering or field armorer skills', NULL, 'Anti-aircraft, secondary anti-personnel and defense. Two gatling-style rail guns in each fixed-forward weapon wing; one or both on a wing fire at one target, but the two wings (four guns) cannot fire in tandem at the same target.'),
